  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "あいての　もちものを　あやつって　こうげき。\nあいてが　どうぐを　もっていない　ばあいは\nしっぱい　する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "상대의 지닌 물건을 조종해서 공격한다.\n상대가 도구를 지니고 있지 않으면 실패한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "操控對手的持有物進行攻擊。\n對手沒有攜帶道具時，\n則會失敗。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le lanceur manipule l’objet tenu par l’ennemi\npour l’attaquer. Échoue si la cible ne tient rien.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der Anwender greift das Ziel mit dessen getragenem\nItem an. Die Attacke schlägt fehl, wenn das Ziel kein\nItem trägt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El usuario ataca utilizando el objeto que lleva el rival.\nSi no tiene ninguno equipado, el movimiento falla.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Chi la usa attacca utilizzando lo strumento\ndel bersaglio. La mossa fallisce se quest’ultimo\nnon ha uno strumento.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The user attacks the target by controlling the target’s\nitem. The move fails if the target doesn’t have an item.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "相手の　持ち物を　あやつって　攻撃。\n相手が　道具を　持っていない　場合は\n失敗する。",
